Gate GUI-only top-level find_package calls on SLIC3R_GUI / ORCA_TOOLS

libslic3r does not link CURL, OpenGL, GLEW, or glfw3. Those deps are
consumed exclusively by the wx GUI (src/slic3r/) and the profile
validator tool. The top-level CMakeLists.txt demanded them
unconditionally via find_package(... REQUIRED), so configure failed
even with SLIC3R_GUI=OFF:

    find_package(CURL REQUIRED)      # L632
    find_package(OpenGL REQUIRED)    # L708
    find_package(GLEW REQUIRED)      # L723
    find_package(glfw3 REQUIRED)     # L725

Our Android build skips all four in deps/ (patch 0001) and wants
SLIC3R_GUI=OFF. Wrap CURL + its libcurl INTERFACE target in
`if (SLIC3R_GUI OR ORCA_TOOLS)` and the GL trio in `if (SLIC3R_GUI)`.

Retire-if: libslic3r ever genuinely links any of these (none do at
v2.3.2, verified against src/libslic3r/CMakeLists.txt:576-606), or
upstream makes these conditional already.

---
